-## Subtopics
-
-### Optimal Linear Volumetric Predictor with Truncated Huffman Coding
-Uses linear prediction of voxel values followed by truncated Huffman coding. Choose when maximizing lossless compression of static volumes is the priority. [Link](7759-optimal-linear-volumetric-predictor-with-truncated-huffman-c.md)
-
-### Lorenz Predictor with Arithmetic Coding
-Uses Lorenz system-based prediction for chaotic-like volumetric data. Choose when data exhibits chaotic spatial correlations. [Link](8070-lorenz-predictor-with-arithmetic-coding.md)
-
-### RDLS-SS-DWT+Pred
-Combines RDLS, subsampling, DWT, and prediction. Choose for high-compression scenarios requiring multi-stage transform. [Link](11251-rdls-ss-dwt-pred.md)
-
-### Closed-Loop DPCM Decompression
-Uses closed-loop DPCM to prevent error accumulation. Choose when temporal consistency or iterative reconstruction is critical. [Link](11737-closed-loop-dpcm-decompression.md)
-
-### Spatial Predictive Coding
-Predicts voxels from spatial neighbors. Choose for general-purpose spatial compression without complex transforms. [Link](12623-spatial-predictive-coding.md)
-
-### Temporal Prediction
-Predicts frames from previous temporal references. Choose for dynamic volumetric data (video). [Link](12644-temporal-prediction.md)
